                                                "sense_id": "36123094-2e19-3d11-951d-d02a1a5c648f",
                                                "text": "It is equally curious that whereas the first Swindon-built Atlantic began its career as a 4-6-0, the first Great Western 4-cylinder 4-6-0 began its career as an Atlantic."
                                            },
